// quote: `Opt<Point>` under `enum:Opt<T: Pr>` is
// claim: An inferred instance is judged as an annotated one: `Opt.Some(Point{…})` under `enum:Opt<T: Pr>` where Point lacks Pr is TYPE-017.
// expect: refuse:NITPICK-TYPE-017
